--- the same gap read through the decay law (CONVENTION-BOUND, do not quote bare) ------------
law: -ln lambda*(L) ~ 2 pi^2 n / ln n, n = N(T*) EXACT count, T* = 2 pi x;
d/dn [n/ln n] = 1/ln n - 1/ln^2 n; delta_n := ln(odd/even) / (2 pi^2 (1/ln n - 1/ln^2 n))
the implied constant is taken at its LAW value 2 pi^2 = 19.739209, NOT at the measured 19.4-20.3;
using the measured constant instead moves delta_n by about 2 per cent. Both are declared.
